<title>THAILAND: Onpa pays 3.50 baht div for 1996.</title>
<headline>Onpa pays 3.50 baht div for 1996.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996:</p>
<p>			  Twelve months</p>
<p>    Div (baht)	  3.50	  vs	 2.25</p>
<p>    Ex-dividend	 April 2, 1997</p>
<p>    Payment date	May 28, 1997</p>
<p>Note: Onpa International Plc is cassette tape producer and music company.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
